 was destroyed. \n (Athens: Tom Brokaw) More coverage on msnbc.com and MSNBC on television noted.", "segment_duration": 280, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63060.0", "legacy_segment_id": 762221, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "9Oz0ysLGVY", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-13", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1730, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 762220, "segment_id": "xh1SvL3YsF", "segment_broadcast_id": "9Oz0ysLGVY", "segment_title": "Iraq / Al-Sadr Revolt", "segment_description": "(Athens: Tom Brokaw) The suspension of fighting in Najaf, Iraq, while radical Shiite cleric Muqtada al-Sadr vowed he would stay there until victory or death, and massive demonstrations across Iraq in support of al-Sadr noted; scenes shown.", "segment_duration": 30, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63340.0", "legacy_segment_id": 762222, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "9Oz0ysLGVY", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-13", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1730, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 762220, "segment_id": "7BMZX63VIy", "segment_broadcast_id": "9Oz0ysLGVY", "segment_title": "Decision 2004 / Bush vs. Kerry / Taxes", "segment_description": "(Athens: Tom Brokaw) Congressional Budget Office figures on tax cuts cited.   (Portland, Oregon: Carl Quintanilla) Campaigning by President Bush & Sen