ys today is the day.] [MAN, International Olympic Committee president Jacques ROGGE&#134;, Greek government spokesman Evangelos ANTONAROS&#134;- comment on the incident involving Kenteris & Thanou.] [US basketball player Dawn STALEY \u2013 comments on safety concerns.] \n (Athens: Tom Brokaw) Swimmer Jenny Thompson, who has 10 Olympic medals and will be participating in Athens, profiled. [THOMPSON \u2013 comments on her decision to go to medical school; explains how being an elite athlete helps her deal with other aspects of her life; comments on swimming to honor her mother, who died of cancer.]", "segment_duration": 360, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63690.0", "legacy_segment_id": 762227, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "9Oz0ysLGVY", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-13", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1730, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 762220, "segment_id": "nu9WJfvrK9", "segment_broadcast_id": "9Oz0ysLGVY", "segment_title": "Upcoming Items (Athens: Tom Brokaw)", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 10, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "64050.0", "legacy_segment_id": 762228, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "9Oz0ysLGVY", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-13", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1730, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 762220, "segment_id": 